<title>JAPAN: Kasumi -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kasumi -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 71.79		vs	   67.59</p>
<p> Operating	    2.18		vs	    1.77</p>
<p> Current		1.96		vs	    1.87</p>
<p> Net		  952    million	  vs	  942    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.15 yen	  vs	   16.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     55 million	  vs	  55 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.50 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kasumi Co Ltd is a supermarket chain operator.</p>
